; Phase 42L - the reckoning. The schism is resolved at the Hierarch's hand-in: her stance node reads
; flag.emberbound.relic_kept / relic_surrendered (42K's answer is the starting position, never
; re-asked), then safeguard / destroy / wield sets flag.emberbound.doctrine_<x>; wield also costs
; +10 corruption. Doctrine (flag), order state (guild.emberbound.finale) and rank are separate facts.

